{"action":"send","subject":"Adapter piece HI – annual price and payment options","body":"Dear Kraslin team,

I recognise that steel and labour costs are putting pressure on you, and that volume matters to your business. We also remember your support in keeping the old price for a quarter in 2022.

Because recent steel movements have eased, [[c2]] we ask for a smaller adjustment than 10%. Because our growing requirement supports production planning, [[c8]] we would pair the price with 6,650 pieces over twelve months.

Our payments have too often been late; we need to correct that. If you can agree the corresponding price, we can offer reliable payment under one of these packages:

• EUR 16.35, 90 days net;
• EUR 16.03, 45 days net;
• EUR 15.73, 14 days net.

All retain FCA, 42-day lead time and a fixed annual price. Which package best balances your cash needs and the annual volume?

Hollerau Pumpenwerke, Purchasing","term_sheets":[{"unit_price":16.35,"payment_days":90},{"unit_price":16.03,"payment_days":45},{"unit_price":15.73,"payment_days":14}],"rationale":"The quote seeks a 10% increase and short payment, while the supplier values volume and has experienced our late payments. These credible opening packages test whether faster, reliable cash earns a discount sufficient to outweigh its financing cost.","target_price":15.73}

